{
  "ledger": [
    "West stall row | Left of central aisle, red awnings, hanging tomato clusters, produce south→north order: purple fruits → orange/yellow fruits → green fruits → red tomatoes, blue-shirt vendor behind counter | Right side of frame (camera facing south), same stalls viewed from north end, produce near→far order: red tomatoes → green fruits → orange/yellow fruits → purple fruits | Shifts from left to right of frame as camera orbits 180° around the woman; camera moves south past successive stall sections, then orbits to the woman's north side",
    "East stall row | Right of central aisle, red/blue awnings, hanging fruit clusters, produce includes apples and green fruits | Left side of frame (camera facing south), stalls with breads/pastries in purple/white trays visible near camera | Shifts from right to left of frame during camera orbit; southern sections of the east stalls (near initial camera position) move out of view as camera moves south",
    "Central market aisle | North-south walkway between west and east stall rows, bidirectional pedestrian flow | North-south walkway between east and west stall rows (relative to reversed camera view), bidirectional pedestrian flow | Camera travels south along the aisle, then completes a 180° counterclockwise orbit around the woman, ending up north of her facing south",
    "Woman with blue umbrella / red apple | Facing camera, walking south down the aisle, watch on left wrist, umbrella held in left hand | Back to camera, walking south away from the new camera viewpoint | Camera orbits 180° around her, transitioning smoothly from front view to back view as she continues southward movement",
    "Blue-shirt west stall vendor | Standing behind west stall counters, left side of frame in background | Standing behind west stall counters, right side of frame in background | Position relative to the woman shifts from her right (camera left) to her left (camera right) consistent with a 180° camera orbit around her"
  ],
